OL,3,GNEWSA'My frustrating 10-year wait for
OL,4,Aarthritis diagnosis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman said a decade-long wait to get
OL,7,Fdiagnosed with a painful inflammatory
OL,8,Farthritis left her frustrated and, at
OL,9,Ftimes, unable to walk.
OL,11,FClare Base, who is in her 40s, from
OL,12,FPortishead, said she lived with
OL,13,Fpersistent pain which caused mobility
OL,14,Fissues and sleeplessness before she was
OL,15,Fdiagnosed with ankylosing spondylitis,
OL,16,Fa form of axial spondyloarthritis
OL,17,F(axSpA).
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
