OL,3,GNEWSA'My frustrating 10-year wait for
OL,4,Aarthritis diagnosis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as a new targeted awareness
OL,7,Fcampaign for the condition, which
OL,8,Faffects one in 200 adults in the UK, is
OL,9,Flaunched for health professionals
OL,10,Facross Bristol and Bath.
OL,12,FBase said she believed the campaign
OL,13,Fwould make a difference and help ensure
OL,14,Fothers struggling with sciatica and
OL,15,Fsevere back pain are taken seriously.
